  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi Anti-Corruption Civil Society Support (MACCSS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increase in the risk for those engaging in serious and organised corruption and related crime, Reduced opportunities to engage in corrupt activities, engage in partnerships which catalyse further interest and investment in anti-corruption.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MACCSS is an FCDO and USAID funded civil society anti-corruption programme which is a combination of a grant and technical assistance programme. Overarching goal is a strengthened anti-corruption environment and increased likelihood and severity of sanctions for serious and organised corruption and related crime.</narrative>
  </description>
